          "Keep the prior procedure available for comparison. End the review with one change and one measure. A case that moves between owners should keep both owner periods visible. Use the same definition across the queue and the review so the counts agree. The parent conference summary case note should show what the conference log held at the time and who reviewed it. The educationvirtualassistant coordinator files the dated parent conference summary note with the case.",
